Dependencies
------------

- github.com/cB-Sigma/mqttsn (Apache-2.0, Copyright 2026 Abhinav
  Gautam): the codecs.
- github.com/cB-Sigma/iotcrypto (Apache-2.0, Copyright 2026 Abhinav
  Gautam): SCRAM (sasl) for the 2.0 client, and AES-CCM through mqttsn.
- github.com/xdg-go/scram, pbkdf2 and stringprep (Apache-2.0), through
  iotcrypto.
- golang.org/x/crypto, x/sys and x/text (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright The Go
  Authors), indirectly.
- The Go standard library (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright The Go Authors).

Interop test peers (interop/, not part of the module's packages)
------------------------------------------------------------------

The nested test-only module interop/ builds the Eclipse Paho MQTT-SN
gateway and sample clients (github.com/eclipse/paho.mqtt-sn.embedded-c,
EPL-2.0 / EDL-1.0, Copyright IBM Corp., Tomoaki Yamaguchi and others) at
a pinned commit from its sources, and installs Mosquitto (EPL-2.0 /
EDL-1.0) from Debian, in a Docker container built on the tester's
machine. The gateway settings and start script in interop/peer are ours
(Apache-2.0). No Paho or Mosquitto source is included in this
repository.

Test data
---------

Client IDs, topics, keys and passwords in this module are made-up demo
values.
